<title>BULGARIA: WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JUNE 17 - SUNNY, WARM.</title>
<headline>WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JUNE 17 - SUNNY, WARM.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunny and warm across the country, state radio said.</p>
<p>Maximum temperatures are expected between 28 and 33 degrees, temperature in Sofia is seen at about 28 degrees.</p>
<p>Air temperatures at the Black Sea coast are expected at 26 and 28 degrees, sea water temperature is seen at 25 degrees. -- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
